{
  "id": "EST.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "EST",
  "reference": "Esita 7",
  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EST 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Hamaniyakasia kakhaywa, omwene niyeerwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuruchi naHamani nibatsia okhulia lisabo ewaEsita omukhaye womuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yakhibili, olwa bali nibanyweetsanga idivai, omuruchi namureeba Esita khandi, ari Lisaayolio lili lirie, omukhaye Esita? Olaheebwa. Eshia osaba nishiina? Shilakholwa, kata okhuula khunusu yoburuchi bwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Esita omukhaye womuruchi nakalusia ari E omuruchi, nimba ningoosibwa imbeliwo, khandi omuruchi naba nachama, embeebwe obulamu bwanje khulwa okhusaaya khwanje, nende abandu banje khulwa okhusaba khwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khukusiibwe, isie nabandu banje, mbu khumuluwe, nikhwirwa, nikhusikha. Ne nikhuba nikhwakhakusibwa khube abakholi abakula abeshisaatsa nabeshikhasi, ndakhaholeelile; shichila obusandibwi bweefwe shibuchelasibwa nende ako aka omuruchi yakhafwilwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Ahasuwero naboola, nareeba Esita omukhayewe, ari Omundu outsaalikha mumwoyokwe okhukhola ario niye wina? Ali heena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita nakalusia mbu Nomundu omusandii khandi omusuku, mbu Hamani uno omubii! Mana indenga niyimuhamba Hamani imbeli womuruchi nomukhayewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi nabuukha, nalulile, narula mwisabo, natsia mulwanyi Iweinzu eyo ikhulundu; naye Hamani nasinjila okhusaba Esita omukhaye obulamubwe; okhuba yalola mbu omuruchi ureelekhwo omwoyo okhumukholela obubii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi nakalukha okhurula mulwanyi Iweinzu ikhulundu, niyeenjila ewa banyweeleelenje idivai, nanyoola Hamani nakwile khushitali ewa Esita yali niyeesetamiye; omuruchi naboola mbu Khane yakhamukwakhwo omukhaye wanje munzu nindiho? Ne amakhuwa ako nikashirula mumunwakwe, bamufuunikha Hamani mumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Haribona, mulala khubasumba abalate bomuruchi abakhalabanila omuruchi, yasunga mbu Lola, omusaala tsana kwoburambi bwamakhono amakhumi karaa-no okwa Hamani yabeele nakholeele Moridekai, owakholela omuruchi amalayi, kushisinjiile munzu yaHamani. Omuruchi nasunga mbu Mumwelesie khukwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibamwelesia Hamani khumusaala okwa yali namukasiliye Moridekai. Mana oburima bwomuruchi nibuhotselekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
